Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 07:19:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] refactor(kanban): extract observable pure pickup gate
 decisions [daveey]

Keep ordered live readers and short-circuit reasons unchanged; retain immutable bounded gate snapshots only in an explicit caller-owned context. Missing facts stay unknown, including after a reader exception. This is a tracing prerequisite, not a full dispatcher trace or fairness acceptance. Proof: canonical pickup tests, all direct worker-node consumers, scripts/check; design and code review by conversation-isolated Opus5.5.
